      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are thrilled to present this beautiful bright and spacious two-bedroom apartment located in the highly sought after Priorsgate development right in the heart of Tallaght Village. The development is always in high demand as it is within easy reach of all local amenities including shopping facilities such as the Square Shopping Centre, a variety of bars & restaurants, an extensive choice of sports grounds & leisure facilities, and a great mix of primary & secondary schools. The area is well serviced with excellent bus routes and road networks and The Red Luas Line is within mere minutes' walk.\r\n \r\nBright and airy internal living accommodation of c. 66 sqm briefly comprises of entrance hall with two separate storage rooms, large open plan living/dining area with fully fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms with built in wardrobes (one master ensuite) and main family bathroom. This apartment has the benefit of a large south facing balcony making it the perfect sun trap on them long sunny summer evenings. \r\nNo. 47 comes to the market in great condition throughout it comes as a blank canvas with no onward chain with plenty of additional features such as fitted wardrobes in both bedrooms, spacious balcony and double-glazed windows to name but a few. There is designated underground parking with a working lift inside the development also. \r\n\r\nDue to size and location, we see this property being extremely popular amongst a wide range of buyers such as first-time buyers looking to get onto the property ladder, investors looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area or anyone looking to downsize and have all amenities on your doorstep so contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information or to arrange a viewing! \r\n\r\nAdditional Features;\r\nBER C\r\nC. 66 sqm\r\nDesignated underground parking space\r\nManagement fee c. 2,500 per annum\r\n2 Bed / 2 Bath\r\nLocated on the third floor\r\nSpacious apartment\r\nBlank canvas \r\nNo onward chain \r\nEntrance hallway with two storage rooms\r\nLarge open plan living/dining area\r\nFully fitted kitchen \r\nTwo generous bedrooms\r\nOne master ensuite\r\nBuilt in wardrobes\r\nMain family bathroom \r\nSunny balcony \r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nElectric heating\r\nAmple storage space\r\nBright and spacious\r\nWithin arm's reach of N7 and M50 Motorway\r\nHighly sought-after development\r\nPrime for first time buyers, investors and downsizers alike!\r\n\r\nDirections - D24FD00"
      },
      {
